1
00:00:02,730 --> 00:00:04,930
- Hey. - Yeah. Yeah, okay. Sure.
-嘿 -嗯、嗯、好啦，當然

2
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:08,000
Look, can we talk about what happened here last night?
聽著，我們可以談談 昨晚這裡發生的事嗎？

3
00:00:08,170 --> 00:00:11,900
Sure. Just give me a second to get all huffy and weird like you.
當然，給我幾秒鐘讓我變得跟你一樣 怒氣衝天、怪裡怪氣的

4
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:17,970
You believe that whoever did something last night did what they did or didn't do?
你敢相信某某人昨天晚上 做了某某事嗎？

5
00:00:18,650 --> 00:00:21,270
Okay, you really don't know what I'm talking about?
你真的不知道我在說什麼嗎？

6
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:23,950
- No. - Okay. Last night, after the party..
-不知道 -好的，昨天晚上，在派對過後…

7
00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:27,710
I saw Rachel kissing that jerk from her office out on your balcony.
我看到瑞秋在你家的陽台上 親她辦公室的那個混蛋

8
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:29,320
Our balcony? Seriously?
在我家陽台？真的嗎？

9
00:00:29,490 --> 00:00:32,860
That's so funny. I told Monica we should put lights on our balcony..
真是好玩，我告訴摩妮卡我們應該 在陽台上加個燈的

10
00:00:33,030 --> 00:00:36,690
and she said, "No, no. It's too cold. Nobody will go out there." And I said:
可是她說「不不，外面太冷了 沒有人會站到外面去的」，然後我說…

11
00:00:36,870 --> 00:00:39,330
"Maybe if we put some lights out there they will."
「如果我們加個燈 或許就會有人了」

12
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:45,370
Right, that's what I came over to talk about. I saw Rachel kissing some guy..
對，那就是我要談的事 我看到瑞秋親吻一個男的…

13
00:00:45,540 --> 00:00:49,310
on your balcony, even though there were no lights!
就在你家陽台上 即使那裡一片漆黑！

14
00:00:50,510 --> 00:00:53,240
So are you gonna talk to her?
那你要跟她談談嗎？

15
00:00:53,450 --> 00:00:57,280
Why? Why should I? I mean, if she wants to move on, that's fine.
為什麼？為什麼我要？ 如果她要找尋新生活，沒關係

16
00:00:57,490 --> 00:01:01,050
You know when "that's fine" sounds true? When someone yells it and spits.
你知道「沒關係」要怎樣說才有 說服力嗎？噴著口水用力吼

17
00:01:01,820 --> 00:01:06,520
No, I'm serious. I mean, if she wants to date people, fine. I don't care.
不，我是說真的，如果她想要跟 別人約會，沒關係，我不在乎

18
00:01:06,690 --> 00:01:08,860
But at least she could have told me.
但是至少她要跟我說啊

19
00:01:09,030 --> 00:01:12,520
You know, I've been putting my life on hold and concentrating on Emma.
你知道的，我的生活都已經停擺 注意力完全集中在艾□身上

20
00:01:12,770 --> 00:01:18,360
But if she wants to go out there kissing guys she barely knows, then so will I.
但是如果她要去親那些不是 很熟的男人，我也要那樣做

21
00:01:21,280 --> 00:01:23,680
Very funny! Ross is gay!
很好笑！羅斯是同志！

22
00:01:25,210 --> 00:01:27,040
No, no. Good, so you're moving on.
不，很好，所以你也要有新的生活了

23
00:01:27,220 --> 00:01:29,710
Do you have any idea where you're moving on to?
你知道你要怎麼樣過新生活嗎？

24
00:01:29,920 --> 00:01:31,820
I've got plenty of opportunities.
我是有很多機會的

25
00:01:31,990 --> 00:01:36,480
Just now, there was some woman at the coffeehouse smiled at me.
剛剛在咖啡廳就有個女人對我笑

26
00:01:36,660 --> 00:01:42,190
And then the other day on the subway, a woman "accidentally" sat on my hand.
還有一天在地鐵，有個女人 「不小心」坐到我的手

27
00:01:42,860 --> 00:01:47,200
Dude, don't rub my face in your crazy single life.
老兄，別再跟我說你瘋狂的單身生活了

28
00:01:47,800 --> 00:01:50,100
And there's an anthropologist at school..
還有，在學校有個人類學家

29
00:01:50,310 --> 00:01:54,040
who totally came on to me during the interdepartmental potluck dinner.
在跨部門餐會的時候 不停在勾搭我

30
00:01:54,240 --> 00:01:56,870
Why did I get married?
我為什麼要結婚呢？

31
00:01:58,818 --> 00:02:00,809
The One Where Monica Sings

00:02:01,100 --> 00:02:02,720
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

32
00:02:47,100 --> 00:02:49,720
Hey, let me ask you guys something.
嘿，讓我問你們一個問題

33
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:51,760
I'm having new headshots taken tomorrow.
我明天要拍新的大頭照

34
00:02:51,930 --> 00:02:55,270
The photographer said she thinks I should have my eyebrows waxed.
攝影師說，她覺得我應該要修眉毛

35
00:02:55,470 --> 00:02:57,770
Is that weird for a guy?
男生那樣做是不是很怪呢？

36
00:02:58,110 --> 00:03:00,270
- Well, it depends. - On?
-嗯，那要看情況 -什麼情況？

37
00:03:00,480 --> 00:03:03,310
On how far along he is in the sex-change process.
看他是在變性過程中的什麼階段囉

38
00:03:04,980 --> 00:03:08,940
No, I totally disagree. I think it's fine for a guy to do something like that.
不，我完全不同意 我覺得男生那樣做沒有什麼

39
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:10,710
Especially an actor.
尤其是演員

40
00:03:10,920 --> 00:03:13,790
I mean, not that you need to. Your eyebrows are..
我不是說你有那個必要，你的眉毛…

41
00:03:17,990 --> 00:03:20,790
Stop it, you guys. Stop staring, you're freaking me out.
你們別這樣，別盯著我看 要嚇死我了

42
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:23,290
Your knuckles are kind of hairy too.
你的手指上也有毛

43
00:03:24,130 --> 00:03:26,790
Oh, man, now I have to get those done too?
天啊，現在我也要除這些毛嗎？

44
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:31,060
- Wow, talk about high maintenance. - You dye your hair.
-哇，你要做的改造可不少啊 -你也染髮啊

45
00:03:31,270 --> 00:03:34,470
- I'm a woman. - Double standards!
-我是女人啊 -雙重標準！

46
00:03:35,780 --> 00:03:38,750
Before I forget, are you coming to Mike's piano bar tonight?
差點忘記 你今晚會去麥克的鋼琴酒吧嗎？

47
00:03:38,950 --> 00:03:42,780
- Only if I don't have to get up and sing. - But everybody sings. It's so fun.
-只要我不需要上台唱歌 -但是大家都要唱歌啊，會很好玩的

48
00:03:42,950 --> 00:03:47,120
Last time, this adorable old man got up there, forgot all the words, flipped out..
上次有個可愛的老先生上台 忘了所有的台詞 糗呆了 

49
00:03:47,290 --> 00:03:51,660
and everyone booed him off the stage. It was so funny.
然後大家就噓他下台，真是好玩

50
00:03:52,990 --> 00:03:55,330
Look, I'm not good at singing.
聽著，我唱歌不行的

51
00:03:55,530 --> 00:03:59,660
Oh, what's the matter? You scared? You afraid I'm a better singer?
喔，怎樣？你怕了嗎？ 怕我唱的比你好嗎？ 

52
00:03:59,830 --> 00:04:02,030
You afraid I'm gonna beat you at singing?
怕我會用唱歌打敗你嗎？

53
00:04:04,340 --> 00:04:07,800
Nope. Nope. It's not working on me.
不，這招對我沒用

54
00:04:07,980 --> 00:04:11,000
Wow, I must be growing up.
哇，我一定是長大了

55
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:17,050
Okay, fine. Just please come and support Mike. You don't have to sing.
好吧，就過來支持麥克就好了 你不需要唱歌

56
00:04:17,290 --> 00:04:21,420
So I don't have to sing, and I can just sit there and pass judgment on others?
所以我不用唱歌，而且還可以坐在那裡 討論、批評其他人？

57
00:04:21,620 --> 00:04:23,850
- While drinking. - I'm there.
-還可以一邊喝酒 -我要去

58
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:28,850
Hi, you guys. Listen, I really need your help.
嘿，你們好 我需要你們的幫忙

59
00:04:29,060 --> 00:04:31,530
I think I did something really stupid.
我想我做了一件很蠢的事

60
00:04:31,700 --> 00:04:35,360
Well, yes, Rachel, but you got something so beautiful out of it.
嗯，是的，瑞秋，但是至少它很漂亮

61
00:04:38,010 --> 00:04:40,800
No, not that. I kissed Gavin last night.
不，不是那件事 我昨晚親了蓋文

62
00:04:41,010 --> 00:04:42,070
- My God. - You kissed him?
-我的天 -你親了他？

63
00:04:42,240 --> 00:04:44,840
Yeah, it was after the party, we were on the balcony..
是啊，就在派對結束之後 我們在陽台上…

64
00:04:45,050 --> 00:04:48,380
Wait, wait, wait. I was at home the whole time. How did I miss that?
等等，我一直都在家，為什麼沒看到？

65
00:04:48,580 --> 00:04:52,710
Well, it was the end of the party. You were probably ironing wrapping paper.
派對才剛結束 你可能正忙著燙平包裝紙

66
00:04:53,550 --> 00:04:55,150
Oh, yeah.
喔，是啊

67
00:04:57,860 --> 00:04:59,720
So how did you end up kissing?
那你們怎麼會親起來的呢？

68
00:04:59,960 --> 00:05:02,260
We were all alone and he was being really nice..
我們單獨在一起，然後他又很體貼

69
00:05:02,460 --> 00:05:05,660
- and he gave me this scarf. - I thought you hated him.
-然後又送我這條圍巾 -我以為你討厭他

70
00:05:05,830 --> 00:05:08,560
Well, there is a thin line between love and hate..
愛與恨之間只有一線之隔

71
00:05:08,740 --> 00:05:13,330
and it turns out that line is a scarf.
而結果，那條線就是這圍巾

72
00:05:15,210 --> 00:05:17,730
Are you thinking of starting something up with this guy?
你在想要跟這男的交往嗎？

73
00:05:17,910 --> 00:05:20,940
I don't know. It's so complicated. I work with this guy.
我不知道，真是太複雜了 這男的是我同事耶

74
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:24,680
I have the baby, and I have Ross. I don't know what to do.
我已經有小孩，有羅斯 我不知道該怎麼辦

75
00:05:24,850 --> 00:05:28,080
And I have to be at the office and see Gavin in 10 minutes.
而我再十分鐘就要進辦公室見到蓋文了

76
00:05:28,290 --> 00:05:31,850
Sounds like you need to think about what you want and talk to Gavin.
聽起來你應該想想 要怎麼跟蓋文說了

77
00:05:32,030 --> 00:05:35,990
- And you definitely should talk to Ross. - Or..
-而且你一定得要跟羅斯說 -或者…

78
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:39,730
I could call in sick and not deal with it at all.
我可以打電話請病假，那就不用管了

79
00:05:40,770 --> 00:05:43,740
Wow! Five months maternity leave, you're back for four days..
哇！請了五個月的產假 才回去上班四天…

80
00:05:43,910 --> 00:05:48,210
kiss a co-worker and call in sick. They are lucky to have you.
親了一個同事就請病假 他們有你這個員工真幸運

81
00:05:56,150 --> 00:05:57,240
- Hi. - Hi.
-嗨 -嗨

82
00:05:57,420 --> 00:06:02,220
- I'm here for my eyebrow appointment. - Name?
-我有預約修眉毛 -什麼姓名？

83
00:06:02,420 --> 00:06:04,150
Chandler Bing.
錢德賓

84
00:06:06,630 --> 00:06:08,090
Okay, very good.
好的，很好

85
00:06:08,260 --> 00:06:11,460
Have a seat right here, Mr. Bing, and Sonya will be right with you.
請先坐一下，賓先生 桑妮亞很快就出來了

86
00:06:11,630 --> 00:06:13,730
Okay. Thanks.
好的，謝謝

87
00:06:59,150 --> 00:07:02,080
I touched the stuff.
我碰了那東西

88
00:07:02,880 --> 00:07:05,150
I'll take care of it.
讓我來處理

89
00:07:09,220 --> 00:07:10,690
Thanks.
謝謝

90
00:07:10,860 --> 00:07:13,950
So do you..? Do you get a lot of guys in here?
那你們… 你們這裡有很多男生會來嗎？

91
00:07:14,130 --> 00:07:16,890
- Oh, absolutely. - Oh, good.
-喔，當然 -喔，很好

92
00:07:17,130 --> 00:07:20,730
- You looking to meet somebody? - All right, let's just do this.
-你想要認識他們嗎？ -好了，我們開始吧

93
00:07:21,970 --> 00:07:24,560
Okay, we'll get to the wax in a minute.
好的，我們等一下再上熱蠟

94
00:07:24,740 --> 00:07:27,500
First, I want to tweeze some of the strays, okay?
首先我要先拔一些雜毛，好嗎？

95
00:07:27,680 --> 00:07:31,630
- Now, this may sting just a little bit. - I have an extremely high threshold..
-這可能會有點痛 -我很可以忍痛…

96
00:07:31,810 --> 00:07:35,870
Holy Mother of God! Oh, my face! My face!
媽媽咪啊！ 喔，我的臉！我的臉！

97
00:07:41,920 --> 00:07:44,220
I'm all right. I'm all right. I'm all right.
我沒事，我沒事，我沒事

98
00:07:44,390 --> 00:07:47,760
It's just a bit of shock, that's all.
只是有點嚇到，沒什麼

99
00:07:47,930 --> 00:07:52,390
- But I'll be fine. You can go again. - Okay.
-但是我沒事，你可以繼續了 -好的

100
00:07:55,900 --> 00:07:57,560
Sorry.
抱歉

101
00:08:02,910 --> 00:08:05,380
Damn it, woman!
可惡，你這女人！

102
00:08:18,690 --> 00:08:22,090
It's the most eligible man in New York. How's the moving on going?
全紐約最有身價的單身漢來了 新生活進行得如何呢？

103
00:08:23,760 --> 00:08:27,790
Not well. I went on the subway again and someone did sit on my hand..
不太好，在地鐵上 又有個人坐到我的手

104
00:08:27,970 --> 00:08:31,930
but that person was neither female nor wearing pants.
但是，這個人既不是女性 也沒有穿內褲

105
00:08:33,370 --> 00:08:37,310
Maybe you're going about this the wrong way. I mean, think about it:
或許你完全錯估情勢了 我是說，你想想看

106
00:08:37,480 --> 00:08:41,940
Single white male, divorced three times, two illegitimate children.
單身白種男性，離婚三次 有兩個非婚生子女

107
00:08:44,190 --> 00:08:46,810
The personal ad writes itself.
你應該要自己心裡有數的

108
00:08:47,820 --> 00:08:51,780
You know, that's funny. Yeah. So do you think you'll ever work again?
真是好笑，是啊 那你覺得你這輩子會找到工作嗎？

109
00:08:53,290 --> 00:08:56,590
What are you doing? You know I can only dish it out.
你在幹嘛？ 你知道我們會鬥個沒完的

110
00:08:57,330 --> 00:09:01,830
I can't believe Rachel just moved on and didn't say anything to me.
我不敢相信，瑞秋就這樣拋下 我們的過去，而且沒有跟我說

111
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:03,630
Maybe she didn't move on.
或許她並沒有拋下

112
00:09:03,800 --> 00:09:07,430
Maybe that kiss was just an impulsive, one-time birthday thing.
或許那只是衝動之下吻的 過生日才發生一次的那種

113
00:09:07,610 --> 00:09:10,600
No, a month ago, she gave her number to some guy in a bar.
不，一個月以前，她還把電話號碼 留給一個在酒吧認識的男的

114
00:09:10,810 --> 00:09:12,900
- Did she go out with him? - No. When he called..
-她有跟他出去嗎？ -沒有，當他打電話來時…

115
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:14,570
I threw the message away.
我把留言丟了

116
00:09:16,420 --> 00:09:18,410
The high road.
真是厲害啊

117
00:09:19,150 --> 00:09:23,610
All right, you know what? Enough. Enough talking. I have to get moving.
你知道嗎？夠了 說夠了，我要展開新生活了

118
00:09:24,230 --> 00:09:28,860
Hey, check out those two blonds over there. Hey, come with me.
嘿，瞧瞧那兩個金髮美眉 嘿，跟我一起過去

119
00:09:29,100 --> 00:09:31,720
Are you trying to get everybody divorced?
你要害每個人都離婚嗎？

120
00:09:32,330 --> 00:09:35,790
You don't have to do anything. It'll just be easier if it's two of us.
你不用做什麼 但是我們兩個一起過去會比較好

121
00:09:35,970 --> 00:09:40,300
Like college, remember? First, you break the ice with some kind of a joke..
就像大學一樣，記得嗎？ 你先過去說笑話熱場面

122
00:09:40,470 --> 00:09:44,540
so they know you're the funny one. I swoop in with interesting conversation..
讓她們知道你是好玩的人 然後我再插入有趣的話題

123
00:09:44,750 --> 00:09:48,980
so they'll see that I'm the brilliant, brooding, sexy one.
讓她們才知道我既聰明 有教養又性感

124
00:09:52,020 --> 00:09:54,390
I thought I got to make the jokes.
我還以為說笑話是我的專利

125
00:09:56,190 --> 00:09:59,350
- Don't you have to be at work? - Oh, come on.
-你不用上班嗎？ -拜託，走吧

126
00:10:02,030 --> 00:10:07,020
Hello. Hi, my name's Chandler. This is my friend Ross right here.
哈囉，我叫錢德 這是我朋友羅斯

127
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:08,790
We were wondering..
我們在想…

128
00:10:08,970 --> 00:10:12,960
if you're up for it, we only need six more people for a human pyramid.
如果你們有興趣的話 我們還需要六個人來完成人體金字塔

129
00:10:15,380 --> 00:10:16,840
Swoop. Swoop.
接手，接手

130
00:10:20,880 --> 00:10:24,680
Hey, I notice you're reading the paper.
嘿，我注意到你在看報紙

131
00:10:24,850 --> 00:10:27,180
Another flood in Europe, huh?
歐洲又有水災了，對嗎？

132
00:10:29,560 --> 00:10:31,650
Here's a question:
問題來了

133
00:10:32,930 --> 00:10:38,060
Would you rather drown or be burned alive?
你寧願被淹死還是被活活燒死？

134
00:10:39,400 --> 00:10:43,840
- I'm sorry, we're just leaving. - Okay.
-很抱歉，我們要走了 -好的

135
00:10:46,940 --> 00:10:48,670
We still got it.
我們還是寶刀未老

136
00:10:57,720 --> 00:11:01,750
- Who is it? - Gavin. I brought you some soup.
-是誰？ -蓋文，我帶一些湯來給你

137
00:11:01,920 --> 00:11:04,410
- Why? - I heard you were sick.
-為什麼？ -我聽說你生病了

138
00:11:04,590 --> 00:11:08,460
Oh, right! Hold on, let me just clean up in here a little bit.
喔，對！等一下 讓我先整理一下

139
00:11:19,210 --> 00:11:21,330
Hello, Gavin.
哈囉，蓋文

140
00:11:22,280 --> 00:11:24,210
I missed you at work. How you feeling?
今天上班我好想你，你還好嗎？

141
00:11:24,410 --> 00:11:28,110
I'm not gonna lie to you, I'm pretty sick.
我不想對你說謊，我病得很重

142
00:11:28,280 --> 00:11:31,450
Oh, good. Because I was having a totally paranoid moment..
喔，好，因為我還擔心…

143
00:11:31,620 --> 00:11:33,850
where I thought you called in sick to avoid me.
你是在裝病逃避我

144
00:11:34,060 --> 00:11:36,960
Oh, no, no, no.
喔，不、不、不

145
00:11:39,860 --> 00:11:41,790
So I had fun last night.
我昨晚很愉快

146
00:11:42,560 --> 00:11:44,460
So did I.
我也是

147
00:11:47,170 --> 00:11:49,400
Exactly how contagious is this thing you have?
你的病到底傳染性有多高呢？

148
00:11:49,570 --> 00:11:54,800
Is it a cold from standing on the balcony, or did a monkey bite you?
是因為站在陽台上受涼了 還是被猴子咬呢？？

149
00:11:55,380 --> 00:11:58,240
- It's just a cold. - Do you have a fever?
-只是單純的感冒 -有發燒嗎？

150
00:11:58,410 --> 00:12:00,680
Let me see.
讓我看看

151
00:12:06,420 --> 00:12:08,120
What? What is it? What's the matter?
怎麼？怎麼了？怎麼回事？

152
00:12:08,290 --> 00:12:10,780
What's Ross doing to you in that picture?
在那張照片中 羅斯在對你做什麼？

153
00:12:10,960 --> 00:12:14,690
Oh, he's dusting me with a fossil brush.
喔，他在用化石刷子幫我除塵

154
00:12:15,530 --> 00:12:18,290
He thought it would be funny.
他覺得那樣很好玩

155
00:12:18,470 --> 00:12:20,700
- Right. Right. - Yeah.
-是啊 -是的

156
00:12:20,900 --> 00:12:22,890
- Ross. - Yeah.
-羅斯 -是啊

157
00:12:23,670 --> 00:12:26,900
What's the deal with you guys? I don't wanna get in the middle of anything.
你們之間有什麼嗎？ 我不想要當第三者

158
00:12:27,110 --> 00:12:32,100
You're not getting in the middle of anything. Don't worry about Ross.
你不是第三者，別擔心羅斯

159
00:12:32,310 --> 00:12:34,680
Hide! That's Ross! Hide!
快躲！是羅斯！躲起來！

160
00:12:35,280 --> 00:12:37,550
- Hide! Hide! - Yeah, but you said not to worry..
-躲起來！躲起來！ -但是你說不用擔心…

161
00:12:37,720 --> 00:12:40,520
I lied and I'm not sick either! Just stay behind the curtain!
我說謊，而且我也沒有生病！ 躲到窗簾後面！

162
00:12:44,630 --> 00:12:47,690
- Hi. - Oh, Molly. You're not Ross.
-嗨 -喔，莫莉，不是羅斯

163
00:12:47,860 --> 00:12:50,730
No. I'm here to take Emma to your mother's, remember?
不是，我是來接艾□到你媽家的 記得嗎？

164
00:12:50,970 --> 00:12:52,520
Right. Yes, yes.
對，是的，是的

165
00:12:53,300 --> 00:12:55,560
- Don't panic. - What?
-別緊張 -怎麼了？

166
00:12:55,740 --> 00:12:58,000
There is a man behind your curtain.
有個男人躲在窗簾後面

167
00:12:58,170 --> 00:13:01,800
- I have Mace in my purse. - No, that's okay! No, no, no.
-我皮包裡有防狼噴霧 -不，沒關係！不、不、不

168
00:13:01,980 --> 00:13:07,000
This is my business associate Gavin being silly. Come out from behind there.
那是我同事蓋文在發神經 出來吧！

169
00:13:08,250 --> 00:13:11,380
Hi. Gavin. Pleased to meet you.
嗨，我叫蓋文，很高興認識你

170
00:13:12,350 --> 00:13:14,820
It was my idea to stand there.
是我要站在那裡的

171
00:13:14,990 --> 00:13:19,260
- Hello. I'll just go get Emma. - Okay.
-哈囉，我去帶艾□ -好的

172
00:13:21,660 --> 00:13:23,690
So..
那麼…

173
00:13:23,860 --> 00:13:27,660
- why did I have to hide? - I thought it was Ross.
-為什麼我要躲呢？ -我以為那是羅斯

174
00:13:27,840 --> 00:13:30,600
I thought there was nothing going on between you.
我以為你們之間已經沒有什麼了

175
00:13:30,840 --> 00:13:32,770
There isn't. There totally isn't.
是沒有，完全沒有

176
00:13:32,970 --> 00:13:37,540
You hear keys in the hall and you jump like a bronco coming out of the chute.
你聽到鑰匙轉動的聲音 就像野牛一樣跳了起來

177
00:13:39,850 --> 00:13:42,010
I used to be a rodeo clown.
我做過鬥牛士

178
00:13:44,790 --> 00:13:47,480
All right, look, Gavin..
好的，聽著，蓋文

179
00:13:50,060 --> 00:13:53,930
I guess I felt guilty that you were here..
我想，你在這裡 讓我覺得有罪惡感

180
00:13:54,090 --> 00:13:56,090
which I shouldn't.
我這樣想是不對的

181
00:13:56,260 --> 00:13:59,860
You know, Ross and l are not in a relationship..
你知道的，羅斯跟我並沒有在交往

182
00:14:00,030 --> 00:14:04,560
but he is the father of my child. And, you know..
他是我孩子的父親，而且…

183
00:14:04,770 --> 00:14:08,370
we do live together. And plus, there's just so much history, you know?
我們還住在一起，還有 我們有太多過去了，你知道嗎？

184
00:14:08,540 --> 00:14:10,440
It's just.. I don't know.
只是…我不知道

185
00:14:10,610 --> 00:14:14,740
- I'm sorry. I'm just all over the place. - It's okay.
-我很抱歉，我頭腦很不清楚了 -沒關係

186
00:14:15,750 --> 00:14:18,880
It's probably not my place, but can I give you a piece of advice?
這或許不關我的事 但是我可以給你一個建議嗎？

187
00:14:19,050 --> 00:14:22,510
- Yes. - You should talk to Ross about all this.
-好的 -你應該跟羅斯談這件事

188
00:14:23,560 --> 00:14:26,030
People keep saying that.
大家都這樣說

189
00:14:28,330 --> 00:14:30,320
I'm sorry, Gavin.
我很抱歉，蓋文

190
00:14:30,530 --> 00:14:32,160
Don't be.
別抱歉

191
00:14:32,330 --> 00:14:35,030
It's just bad timing.
只是現在不是好時機

192
00:14:36,300 --> 00:14:38,460
So seriously, rodeo clown?
講真的嗎？鬥牛士？

193
00:14:39,340 --> 00:14:42,040
One of the best, ma'am. One of the best.
技術最棒的，小姐 技術最棒的

194
00:14:44,550 --> 00:14:46,677
（鋼琴酒吧與夜總會）

195
00:15:10,370 --> 00:15:14,140
Oh, she's my girlfriend. That's not just how we do it here.
喔，她是我女朋友 不只是在台上而已

196
00:15:14,380 --> 00:15:16,870
I'm gonna take a little break, and when we come back..
我要休息一下，當我們回來時

197
00:15:17,080 --> 00:15:20,440
we've got Kenneth singing "I Touch Myself."
肯尼將要演唱「我自摸」

198
00:15:21,120 --> 00:15:23,780
I'm not here to judge.
我不是來當評審的

199
00:15:27,220 --> 00:15:30,450
- You have got to sing. - No, I told you I can't.
-你一定要上台唱 -不，我告訴過你我不行

200
00:15:30,660 --> 00:15:34,120
But you would have so much fun. And you have a really nice voice.
但是你會很喜歡的 而且你的聲音很好啊

201
00:15:34,800 --> 00:15:37,860
- When have you heard me sing? - All the time, when you're cooking.
-你是何時聽到我唱歌的？ -常常，當你在煮飯的時候

202
00:15:38,100 --> 00:15:39,660
- What? - Yeah, you're always singing:
-什麼？ -是啊，你總是一邊唱著…

203
00:15:39,830 --> 00:15:42,630
Yummy, yummy, yummy I've got love in my tummy
好吃，好吃，好吃 我肚肚裡有愛愛

204
00:15:43,970 --> 00:15:45,630
Yeah, I do rock that one.
是啊，我那倒是唱得不錯

205
00:15:47,840 --> 00:15:51,000
Isn't there just a little part of you that wants to get up there?
你難道一點都不想要上去唱嗎？

206
00:15:51,880 --> 00:15:55,250
Just a little. But, God, it's so scary.
一點而已，但是老天，好可怕喔

207
00:15:55,420 --> 00:15:57,410
I don't even know what I would sing.
我根本不知道要唱什麼

208
00:15:57,650 --> 00:16:00,310
- Well, I've got a book around.. - "Delta Dawn."
-嗯，我有一本歌本在… -「破曉時分」

209
00:16:03,963 --> 00:16:06,329
（中央咖啡廳）

210
00:16:08,900 --> 00:16:14,270
Hi. I couldn't help but notice, but that's an unusual necklace.
嗨，我不得不注意到 你特別的項鏈

211
00:16:14,440 --> 00:16:17,340
You already hit on me an hour ago.
你一個小時前就來搭訕過了

212
00:16:19,010 --> 00:16:22,670
Right. So that's a firm no?
沒錯，所以確定不要嗎？

213
00:16:28,550 --> 00:16:31,450
I don't believe this. I just keep striking out.
我不敢相信，我一直被判出局

214
00:16:31,690 --> 00:16:34,090
I don't get it either.
我也不敢相信

215
00:16:34,250 --> 00:16:36,950
I mean, you're obviously desperate.
我是說，很明顯地你是很飢渴了

216
00:16:37,160 --> 00:16:40,960
You're asking women how they wanna be killed.
你問女人她們想要如何死法

217
00:16:41,160 --> 00:16:44,260
This is great. Rachel's gonna keep kissing guys..
太棒了，瑞秋繼續去親男人…

218
00:16:44,430 --> 00:16:48,300
until she finds the one she wants, and I'm gonna die alone.
直到她找到她想要的男人 而我將孤單地死去

219
00:16:48,540 --> 00:16:51,470
By drowning or..?
是淹死還是…

220
00:16:53,070 --> 00:16:57,100
- Why would he break up with me? - I don't know, sweetie.
-他為什麼要跟我分手呢？ -我不知道，親愛的

221
00:16:57,280 --> 00:17:01,580
All I ever wanted was to just love him and have him love me back.
我要的只不過是愛他，希望他也愛我

222
00:17:01,750 --> 00:17:05,480
I mean, am I so unlovable?
我是說，我有這麼不值得愛嗎？

223
00:17:05,690 --> 00:17:08,780
- Wow. - I know.
-哇 -對了

224
00:17:17,430 --> 00:17:20,090
All right. That was Kenneth with his..
好了，以上是肯尼所帶來的…

225
00:17:20,270 --> 00:17:24,070
much too literal rendition of "I Touch Myself."
即興表演「我自摸」

226
00:17:24,240 --> 00:17:28,330
Coming up next, we've got Monica singing "Delta Dawn."
接下來是摩妮卡演唱「破曉時分」

227
00:17:28,940 --> 00:17:31,430
Wait. I can't sing in front of all these people.
等等，我不能在這些人面前唱

228
00:17:31,650 --> 00:17:34,010
Just pretend they're not even here. It's okay.
假裝他們不在，沒關係的

229
00:17:34,180 --> 00:17:38,850
Once that spotlight hits you, it's so bright, you won't see anyone anyway.
一旦聚光燈照到你，會很亮的 反正你也看不到任何人

230
00:17:41,490 --> 00:17:46,120
Hi, I'm Monica. And I'm going to be singing "Delta Dawn."
嗨，我是摩妮卡 我要唱的是「破曉時分」

231
00:18:10,320 --> 00:18:14,780
- Can you totally see through her shirt? - Like an x-ray.
-你可以看穿她的上衣嗎？ -像X光一樣

232
00:18:15,660 --> 00:18:18,680
Bad day not to wear a bra.
今天不是不穿內衣的好日子

233
00:18:35,380 --> 00:18:38,240
I'm calling about the advertising job.
我打來詢問廣告工作的

234
00:18:38,410 --> 00:18:41,070
Yes, I realize it would be entry level.
是的，我瞭解這是基層職務

235
00:18:42,080 --> 00:18:45,780
Oh, so would I actually have to wear the chicken suit?
喔，所以我真的要穿小雞裝嗎？

236
00:18:47,790 --> 00:18:50,280
I need your help.
我需要你的幫忙

237
00:18:52,330 --> 00:18:54,420
Wow, it seems serious.
哇，看起來很嚴重

238
00:18:55,030 --> 00:18:58,160
What seems to be the problem, Ashley Judd?
是怎麼了呢？艾希莉賈德？

239
00:18:58,330 --> 00:19:02,330
I'm getting new headshots taken. So I went to get my eyebrows shaped.
我要照新的大頭照 所以我去修了眉毛

240
00:19:02,540 --> 00:19:05,470
I'm sorry. Moment to make fun of that, please.
很抱歉，讓我笑一下吧

241
00:19:06,170 --> 00:19:10,300
I may be a sissy, but I'll still pound you into the ground.
我看起來可能娘娘腔的 但是我還是可以海扁你的

242
00:19:10,510 --> 00:19:14,350
Look, it hurt so bad, I could only let her do one eyebrow, and now..
聽著，好痛喔，我只能讓她做一邊 所以就…

243
00:19:14,520 --> 00:19:17,280
they don't match!
兩邊不對稱了！

244
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:33,690
It's like a baby caterpillar chasing its mama.
就像是毛毛蟲寶寶在追媽媽一樣

245
00:19:33,870 --> 00:19:37,030
You got to help me out, okay? Look, I have a magic marker.
你得要幫我，好嗎？ 看，我有麥克筆

246
00:19:37,200 --> 00:19:40,170
Fill in the skinny one so I don't look stupid for my pictures.
幫我把細的這邊劃粗 照起相來才不會很蠢

247
00:19:40,370 --> 00:19:42,970
Okay, first of all, this is green.
好的，但是，首先這是綠色的

248
00:19:43,410 --> 00:19:46,210
- What the hell am I supposed to do?! - I will help you out..
-我他媽的該怎麼辦呢？ -我會幫你的

249
00:19:46,380 --> 00:19:51,010
but you have to promise you won't tell anyone what I'm about to tell you.
但是你要答應我 不會把我要告訴你的事說出去

250
00:19:51,190 --> 00:19:53,810
What? What?
什麼事？什麼事？

251
00:19:54,150 --> 00:19:55,490
Okay.
好了

252
00:19:55,660 --> 00:19:58,750
You know how most kids get their allowance from mowing the lawn..
你知道大部分的小孩都是利用除草 或是倒垃圾什麼的…

253
00:19:58,930 --> 00:20:03,520
or taking out the garbage? Well, I earned mine..
來賺取零用錢 而我賺零用錢的方式…

254
00:20:03,700 --> 00:20:09,660
by plucking the eyebrows of my father and his "business partners."
就是幫我父親 還有他的「合夥人」拔眉毛

255
00:20:14,240 --> 00:20:16,070
Oh, my God.
喔，我的天

256
00:20:16,480 --> 00:20:19,810
Yeah, well, I guess you don't need my help, Victor-Victoria.
好的，我猜你不需要我的幫忙了 喬伊美眉

257
00:20:20,010 --> 00:20:23,040
No, no, no. I do. I do. I need your help.
不、不、不，我要，我要 我需要你的幫忙

258
00:20:23,280 --> 00:20:26,880
But, Chandler, I don't know if I can take any more plucking. It hurt so bad.
但是錢德，我不知道能不能 再忍受拔毛，真的好痛

259
00:20:27,090 --> 00:20:31,850
Not with my combination of ice cubes, aloe vera and my gentle..
安啦，有我的冰塊跟蘆薈配方 加上…

260
00:20:32,030 --> 00:20:35,550
self-loathing touch.
連自己也厭惡的溫柔接觸

261
00:20:51,110 --> 00:20:53,880
I'm sorry, the song's over.
我很抱歉，歌唱完了

262
00:20:56,250 --> 00:20:59,410
- Did you see me up there? - Every little bit of you.
-你有看到我在上面嗎？ -全身上下看透透

263
00:21:00,820 --> 00:21:04,260
I can't believe I sang in front of people and they liked me.
我不敢相信我在大家面前唱歌 而且他們喜歡我

264
00:21:04,420 --> 00:21:07,050
Did you hear that guy shouting, "Look at those tips"?
你們有聽到還有人大喊 「瞧瞧那些小費（意同乳頭）」嗎？

265
00:21:07,230 --> 00:21:11,100
I mean, did I really help you get a lot of tips?
我是說，我有幫你多賺小費嗎？

266
00:21:11,270 --> 00:21:12,390
Sure.
當然有

267
00:21:14,100 --> 00:21:17,700
- Mon, not that you didn't sound good.. - Good?
-摩妮卡，不是說你唱的不好… -不好？

268
00:21:17,900 --> 00:21:21,310
Didn't you hear them? I was great!
你沒有聽到他們的叫聲嗎？ 我棒透了！

269
00:21:21,480 --> 00:21:26,140
Thank you so much for making me do this. That is the best gift ever.
謝謝你逼我這樣做 這是我有過最好的禮物了

270
00:21:26,380 --> 00:21:29,110
Also a good gift: underwear.
內衣也會是好禮物

271
00:21:32,790 --> 00:21:35,480
Thank you so much for letting me do this.
謝謝你讓我過來

272
00:21:35,720 --> 00:21:39,780
Public bathrooms freak me out. I can't even pee, let alone do anything else.
公共廁所讓我覺得很惡 我根本沒有辦法上廁所，更別說其他的

273
00:21:40,230 --> 00:21:43,820
But what's great is you don't mind talking about it.
但是更棒的是，你根本不介意說出來

274
00:21:44,000 --> 00:21:48,630
It is so amazing that I met you on the same day that Eric broke up with me..
這真是太神奇了，在我跟艾瑞克分手的這一天，我就遇見了你

275
00:21:48,800 --> 00:21:52,670
because it's like, you lose a boyfriend, and you get a boyfriend.
這就是，失去一個男朋友 又得到一個男朋友

276
00:21:55,010 --> 00:21:59,970
No, don't worry. This is not some rebound thing. I am totally over Eric.
你不用擔心，這不是補貨療傷法 我已經完全不愛艾瑞克了

277
00:22:07,150 --> 00:22:09,680
Good choice, Ross.
挑的真好，羅斯

278
00:22:11,430 --> 00:22:13,660
Hey. Hi. There you are.
嘿，嗨，你在家

279
00:22:13,890 --> 00:22:17,460
- I've been looking for you everywhere. - Hello. Well, here I am.
-我到處在找你 -哈囉，我在家

280
00:22:17,660 --> 00:22:20,630
My mom is not bringing the baby back until 9:00.
我媽到九點才會把孩子帶過來

281
00:22:20,800 --> 00:22:25,330
So I was hoping you and I could have a chance to kind of..
所以我希望，我們可以有機會來…

282
00:22:27,840 --> 00:22:30,610
- Somebody here? - Oh, yeah. That's Michelle.
-有人在這裡嗎？ -是的，是蜜雪兒

283
00:22:30,780 --> 00:22:33,940
- Who? - Oh, just this woman I've been seeing.
-誰？ -喔，是我最近在約會的女生

284
00:22:35,480 --> 00:22:38,820
- You've been seeing someone? - Yeah, didn't I mention that?
-你有在約會？ -是啊，我沒有提過嗎？

285
00:22:38,990 --> 00:22:41,890
I mean, we haven't been going out too long..
我是說，我們並沒有約會很久

286
00:22:42,060 --> 00:22:45,960
but there's this amazing connection between us.
但是我們之間有很奇妙的感情

287
00:22:46,130 --> 00:22:49,890
I mean, in fact just before you came in, she called me her boyfriend.
而且就在你進來之前 她才說我是她男朋友

288
